# A tour of Pause > Settings: Options (controls), Statistics, Cheat codes, Display, Performance.
include boot-to-roam.pad
wait 1s 60f
press start 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
shot {SHOTS}/00-settings.png 0.5
press a 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
screens
shot {SHOTS}/01-options.png 0.5
press down 4f
wait 400ms 24f
